--- !u!114 &1209064764
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1209064763}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28353f6113010cc49ab9e8d231f40af5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OfficeDialogueController
  assistantController: {fileID: 1209064767}
  gameStateController: {fileID: 1681669335}
  choiceCanvas: {fileID: 1472470781}
  jobExplanationButton: {fileID: 1659688365}
  exploreOfficeButton: {fileID: 881631556}
  startWorkButton: {fileID: 110311890}
  finishReadingButton: {fileID: 166225872}
  computerScreenContent: {fileID: 1860716679}
  greetingLines:
  - text: "Good morning \u2014 well, it's always morning somewhere in someone's memory,
      right?  I'm your assistant. You can call me\u2026 actually, I don't have a
      name yet. Maybe you can give me one later?"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d62dea708293414f9180ce05368593c, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Anyway! Welcome to the Memory Organizer workspace. Your client is currently
      in REM sleep and waiting for us. No pressure \u2014 they're literally unconscious."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3e059c388ac8aaa4f9b4408546d9d9fb, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: Before we dive in, would you like to learn more about what a Memory Organizer
      does, take a look around the office, or just jump right in?
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 141fb3878cd20ab49810bc11a3606334, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: ' I promise all three options are equally valid. Well, two of them buy
      me more time to finish my system check.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 02afbeff517d8b1498bd9ad76d855f25, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  jobExplanationLines:
  - text: "Great question! So, a Memory Organizer is kind of like\u2026 an interior
      designer for the mind. Except you can't knock down walls, and the furniture
      has feelings."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e23422028c103c0428c7cfbbf0d65188, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 3
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Here's the important part \u2014 and I always emphasize this to new Organizers:
      you cannot delete, alter, or create memories. That's not how brains work, and
      honestly, it would be terrifying if it were."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1e594764018eda14dbe3b6766d0d778d, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 3
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: What you CAN do is help the client decide how much attention each memory
      gets.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 636ec91d43f426548982b2ef1a407966, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 3
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: Does that make sense? I practiced that explanation seventeen times in the
      mirror. The mirror was not impressed, but I think it went okay.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bae91e659eee2a24895ed374a1b924e5, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 3
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  explorationDepartureLines:
  - text: "Ooh, exploring! Take your time \u2014 I'll just be here\u2026 floating.
      Very still. Radiating patience."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6f73af4589fd2544abf78e88e7ba14d5, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 3
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "When you're ready to continue, just come find me. I'm not going anywhere.
      Literally \u2014 I don't have legs."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c2e373ef74d394b4894d1551e14cedc9, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 3
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  explorationReturnLines:
  - text: You're back! Did you find anything interesting? I spent the time reorganizing
      my internal file structure. Alphabetically. It was very satisfying.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d106075d66078d4f9f7b8defff78ee8, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: 'Ready to get started for real this time? The client''s been in REM for
      a while now. '
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38bfc42b1cbeb0e42b35f93e3f354ab7, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 1
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: They're probably having the most interesting dreams while we chat.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e0dd09927cfe1744e87ebde5a9b180d6, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 1
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  startWorkLines:
  - text: 'Alright! Here we go. Professional mode: engaged.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe6953d5eb69a354c8233f8a0b8b915a, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Let me pull up the client's file. One moment\u2026 and\u2026 there we
      are. The computer screen should be showing the case details now. "
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f68ef6e35f17d849a4140af789e8fce, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Take a moment to review them \u2014 I'll wait. Again. I'm very good at
      waiting."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6eab328748a807b479d7417d7a393370, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  crystalBallInstructionLines:
  - text: "Client report reviewed? Great. Now \u2014 do you see that crystal ball
      that just appeared? That's our entry point into the client's subconscious."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 83ab75b5b71889841a9785fa8bd33d8d, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: Place your hand on the crystal ball and keep it there. It needs about two
      seconds to establish a stable connection.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d49499b9af28a524c8222ac4d2129a28, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Well. See you on the other side! \u2026 That sounded more dramatic than
      I intended. But also, I meant it."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 81829978eedf4a4468a8a4085e426f4e, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 1
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
