--- !u!114 &1209064767
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1209064763}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 80c3b1316db4a3e48aa83df2c8f3f9b0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AssistantController
  audioSource: {fileID: 1209064765}
  subtitleText: {fileID: 994167672}
  hippocampusIntroLines:
  - text: And we're here! Welcome to the memory space. Everything you see around
      you? These are the client's established memories, the ones that have been here
      for years.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d820aec6ac08bc94e9657f7c6386a257, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: Let me explain how this works. These are the client's recent memories,
      you can pick up and examine. Your job is to decide how much current attention
      each one deserves.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d80196adbf328314dbc5389856cdf2fc, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "There are three attention zones on the wall. 'Focus' \u2014 for memories
      that need immediate, active attention. 'Context' \u2014 for memories that should
      stay available as useful background. And 'Background' \u2014 for memories that
      are still present and accessible, but don't need to dominate awareness right
      now."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a2fe8d8eea94dc346b70e7f75db4daf8, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  waterBottleMemoryLines:
  - text: "Ah, this one\u2026 The client has a fever. Everyone else has gone home.
      He's drinking water, taking medicine, and just\u2026 keeping going.\n"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4b29dac6f603c64ba4f69de407e95b7, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 1
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  sunsetPhotoMemoryLines:
  - text: "Oh, this is a beautiful one. He took this photo. Not for social media,
      not to show anyone. Just\u2026 because the sky looked beautiful, and that felt
      worth remembering."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 19093a9d6c98a504e801d93f3879dfc9, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 1
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  legoBricksMemoryLines:
  - text: "Look at this! The client spent a whole evening assembling this model \u2014
      brick by brick. He fell into that deep, quiet focus where time just\u2026 disappears.
      There's only pure, private satisfaction. The kind that doesn't need an audience."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a705b2575fb508d4c8199c03e7926aff, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 1
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  missingPainfulMemoryLines:
  - text: "Hmm. Wait a moment. Something's not right here\u2026"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 939005e8b56be1646b2db23fa7056513, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Those established memories \u2014 they're all\u2026 pleasant. Or at least,
      not deeply painful."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b70b6559374ded34091c085b87a58c92, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "But that can't be right. A normal memory space doesn't look like this
      \u2014 it's never just the happy stuff. The painful ones should be here too.
      Where are they?"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 28a3d514570b9e0468aa78e0631e9db9, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: Let's finish placing these three first. But I'm going to keep an eye on
      things. Metaphorically. I don't actually have eyelids. Also, my left sensor
      array has been glitching since Tuesday, so if I miss something, that's my excuse.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 449ee2ce1e160024e87335aec03e1620, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  nightmareWarningLines:
  - text: "Wait \u2014 I heard something."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e7c7624178d56b4dadbc08f3e08deb5, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Um. I'm picking up a\u2026 very large presence. Approaching. Rapidly.
      I don't know what it is..."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85fa26f0dc00ad5438a1da17a6b4b947, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: WHAT IS THAT. WHAT!!!!
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe436d24e64f86d4e9d3532da068d9ae, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Okay. I can just teleport us back to\u2026 wait. The signal  is getting
      weaker."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38dde3ae531d7f747be92c118aef1de3, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  swallowTransitionLines:
  - text: OH NO NO NO
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 17ead2805feffd34ea5c44d1e9936ad5, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 0
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  mirrorChamberIntroLines:
  - text: "Well, That's so\u2026 intimate. And so loud."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8d8927a98ae6a234e8be2f84bdad09bf, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Wait. Those voices\u2026 I recognize these. These are the client's painful
      memories. The ones that were missing from the memory room. They've been trapped
      here \u2014 trapped inside those\u2026 those containers."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b561bd7820caded4d97060b4cc5ac234, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "I think\u2026 I think you need to talk to them. Each one. The voices are
      loud because nobody's ever really answered them \u2014 just let them talk. "
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b059592125585d546a3c751ae92bf6cc, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: 'Maybe if someone responds differently, something changes? I''m guessing
      here. This is definitely not in my manual.

'
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 064ae7f31b17e3f40bd12eaf33164ae2, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "I'll stay close. Or as close as I can without getting in your way, keep
      trying to reconnect to the outside. And if anything goes wrong, I'll\u2026
      well, I'll think of something. Probably."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 84b69fbc53b698b49a9f67ff0503407b, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  memoryReleasedLines:
  - text: "It broke! On its own - you didn\u2019t even touch it! And the echo disappeared!"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 50f9cfaa48ea60843b7e7c855ff416ed, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: And look - the real memory was still there. Intact. Waiting. It just needed
      to be understood differently.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c3d819860ac34ee4f9b1a50468f0f496, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  allMemoriesReleasedLines:
  - text: "That\u2019s all four! Every single painful echo has been quieted. The
      real memories - they\u2019re all free now."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8955eb10fb2c5594cad898839e45445e, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Can you feel that? The whole space is shifting. Without the echoes feeding
      it, this place can\u2019t hold itself together. It\u2019s coming apart!"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7bf96d70e001a1c4b8f336eb18142323, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Wait - the signal! It\u2019s coming back! The connection is re-establishing.
      I can lock onto the memory room coordinates now!"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9ed9dd1eb5b1a8d46b9680bb12517f5e, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "I\u2019m initiating the transfer! Everyone hold on - we are LEAVING!"
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2ac80c901348e1c4c830abf6ce007cf1, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 1
  returnToMemorySpaceLines:
  - text: "And we\u2019re back. The memory room. Solid ground. Familiar walls. No
      giant clowns in sight. I have never been so relieved to see this place."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3a45a10d76ea88f43949545f9057f1ad, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: Although, that ceiling is definitely going to need some work. Structural
      damage is NOT in our job description.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c98033ba1dc64184689626e7ed5c271d, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: "Now there\u2019s one more big task ahead - the final attention redistribution
      with all seven memories. When you\u2019re ready, hit the confirm button."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d55a84ed7a9adfe4999625fee8fd08f9, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  confirmationResponseLines:
  - text: Final distribution confirmed! Alright - let's head back to the office and
      see what the report says. See you on the other side!
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd553689ee52c4045a69a091c6c3b442, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  officeReturnAndReportLines:
  - text: "And we're back in the office! The computer should already be processing
      the session data\u2026 yep, the report is ready. Go ahead and select 'View
      Report' - let's see what your final distribution looks like on paper."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7f494605ac9376c4583c8468fd9b69b5, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 2
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  sessionClosingLines:
  - text: Session data saved. The client is still asleep. But when he wakes, he may
      notice that something has changed.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dfede6be12530d64595a756c7364d1b7, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 3
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
  - text: That's all for today, Memory Organizer. See you next session.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 36c082e7f012c7c42af623149981ef81, type: 3}
    fallbackSubtitleDuration: 3
    keepVisibleAfterLine: 0
